#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_backend__webhook_external_id
msgid ""
"What Channex calls the notification we registered. Kept so the same one is "
"updated instead of piling up a new one every time."
msgstr ""
"Cómo llama Channex a la notificación que registramos. Se guarda para actualizar siempre la misma en lugar de acumular una nueva cada vez."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_channel__external_id
msgid "What a booking carries, so it is what the partner is resolved by."
msgstr "Lo que trae una reserva, por lo que es lo que se usa para resolver el cliente."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_booking_revision__state
msgid ""
"What became of this message. There is no state for work still to be done: "
"that is what the job queue is for."
msgstr ""
"Qué ocurrió con este mensaje. No hay un estado para el trabajo pendiente: para eso está la cola de trabajos."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_booking_revision__channel_id
msgid ""
"What the agency is resolved by. Channex does not document it on this "
"payload, so it may well come in empty."
msgstr ""
"Lo que se usa para resolver la agencia. Channex no lo documenta en este contenido, así que puede llegar vacío."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_booking_revision__inserted_at
msgid "When Channex received the message from the OTA."
msgstr "Cuándo recibió Channex el mensaje de la OTA."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_booking_revision__acknowledged_at
msgid ""
"When Channex was told the message is in. From then on it is not handed over "
"again, so it is only ever stamped after the folio is saved for good."
msgstr ""
"Cuándo se avisó a Channex de que el mensaje ha entrado. A partir de ese momento no se vuelve a entregar, por lo que solo se marca después de guardar definitivamente la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_pms_folio__force_nothing_to_invoice
msgid ""
"When you set this field, the folio will be considered as nothin to invoice, "
"even when there may be ordered quantities pending to invoice."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa este campo, la ficha se considerará sin nada que facturar, aunque haya cantidades pedidas pendientes de facturar."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_backend__webhook_url
msgid ""
"Where Channex is told to call. It hangs off the web base URL, so it is only "
"reachable once that is a public address."
msgstr ""
"Dónde se le dice a Channex que llame. Cuelga de la URL base web, así que solo es accesible cuando esta es una dirección pública."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_booking_revision__error
msgid ""
"Why the message could not become a folio, when that is something the hotel "
"can settle. It stays unacknowledged, so fixing the cause and reading the "
"feed again is all it takes."
msgstr ""
"Por qué el mensaje no pudo convertirse en una ficha, cuando es algo que el hotel puede resolver. Queda sin confirmar, así que basta con corregir la causa y volver a leer el feed."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_pms_property__zip
msgid "Zip"
msgstr "C.P."

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_pms_property__free_room_ids
msgid ""
"allows you to send different parameters in the context (checkin(required), "
"checkout(required), room_type_id, ubication_id, capacity, amenity_ids and / "
"or pricelist_id) and return rooms available"
msgstr ""
"Permite enviar diferentes parámetros en el contexto (checkin(required), checkout(required), room_type_id, ubication_id, capacity, amenity_ids and / or pricelist_id) y devolver habitaciones disponibles"

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_channex.field_channel_channex_pms_property__availability
msgid ""
"allows you to send different parameters in the context (checkin(required), "
"checkout(required), room_type_id, ubication_id, capacity,amenity_ids and / "
"or pricelist_id) check the availability for the hotel"
msgstr ""
"Permite enviar diferentes parámetros en el contexto (checkin(required), checkout(required), room_type_id, ubication_id, capacity,amenity_ids and / or pricelist_id) verifique la disponibilidad del hotel"

#. module: connector_pms_channex
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:connector_pms_channex.channel_channex_backend_view_form
msgid ""
"channel(s) have no agency. Their bookings would come in\n"
"                                with nobody to attribute them to."
msgstr ""
"canal(es) sin agencia. Sus reservas entrarían\n"
"                                sin nadie a quien atribuirlas."

